      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Martial PoiseEnter a movement command while winding up Kalista's basic attack or Pierce to lunge a short distance when she launches her attack. Lunge distance scales with boot tier. Kalista's basic attacks have unique drawbacks. They:Cannot be cancelled;Miss if her target leaves vision;Deal only 90% of her total attack damage.",
